                        "entry_id": "ea76650a-0a72-32d3-9828-3b7b364de71a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Conspiratorial."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "59edb2e1-76b1-45cd-91da-044c4ee46986",
                                "sense_id": "f56c4828-5a97-3254-9fd3-c5d16bf62984",
                                "text": "In all capitalist countries the factory cell can operate only as a conspirative organization. Consequently its work, and the work of each member, must be conducted in such a way that the various police agents in the factory should [be unaware]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8761ba6-93bc-4c20-8a4f-1bd4d7947dff",
                                "sense_id": "f56c4828-5a97-3254-9fd3-c5d16bf62984",
                                "text": "The Protestant church and many of its members were also involved in this conspirative activity. In the 1960s, the leadership of the church made a new, cooperative arrangement with the state, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6c82630-f95d-4e9b-8f32-8ca0ac086070",
                                "sense_id": "f56c4828-5a97-3254-9fd3-c5d16bf62984",
                                "text": "The intellectuals characterized by conspirative avant-gardism agreed with much of the critique of the non-Marxists, but instead of moving outside the state and th party, they developed a conspirative mentality to work in and around it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "69bb5a79-a01b-49b4-9799-51097c8e54e9",
                                "sense_id": "f56c4828-5a97-3254-9fd3-c5d16bf62984",
                                "text": "On 9 March 1983, the cops suddenly stormed the student hostel “Karlshof” in Darmstadt, Alfred-Messel-Weg 10c, our first loss of a conspirative apartment. We only realized the connection in mid-March."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
